WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.903
-It is nice after the hurricane
to see you here dry.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, I know.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not in your iconic
black T-shirt.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
-I saw your bit.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:09.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know you enjoyed
our hurricane coverage.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:10.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I enjoy
your hurricane coverage.

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:12.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
I enjoy the Anderson Cooper
black T-shirt.

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:13.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
How did you first
find your way --

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:15.081
-I was gonna bring out, like,

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:17.484
a little, tiny,
baby black T-shirt to give you,

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:20.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I couldn´t find one.
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There were all being washed
by me.

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How do you find your way
to a black T-shirt

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the first place?
-So, there´s a reason why

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.093
you wear a black T-shirt, like,
in the field or in a storm,

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
is because, "A,"
you´re wet all of the time.

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:29.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:30.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And if you´re
in a light-colored T-shirt

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you´re dirty,

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
people are gonna comment
on how dirty you are.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:35.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
-If you´re sweating
and you´re not wet --

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.170
you´re just sweating -- then
they´ll comment on how sweaty --

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
and black or dark shirts
hide the sweat.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
So there´s a reason for it.
-Yeah.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:44.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I feel like you´re still
the only guy doing it.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. Are you -- no.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:46.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, maybe so.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.548
-Well, I feel like other guys,
like, wear slickers and coats.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you will stay in
the black T-shirt longer.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.718
-No, that´s not true. I´ll --
I´ll wear a -- I´ll wear a coat.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Both laugh ]
-Okay.

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:55.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But when you´re sopping wet,
it doesn´t matter,

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:56.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, you´re wet.
-Yeah.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.024
-So no matter what you --
you´re wearing a coat,

00:00:58.024 --> 00:00:59.459
but, like, the water comes in.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s like having people
throw buckets of water at you

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
for 13 hours.
-Yeah.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You´re sopping wet.
You might as well, you know...

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:07.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just rock a black T-shirt.
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:10.537
Do we -- We kind of made this
point on our show last week.

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:11.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:12.906 size:84% position:42%
-That we think you guys
should all go inside.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.374 size:75% position:38%
-[ Laughing ] Right.

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:16.276
-Can you make the argument for
why you have to be out there?

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:19.079
-I mean, look -- first of all,

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:21.881
we all do things which,
you know, you -- You´ve what? --

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:24.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´ve hosted the
CFDA Fashion Awards twice now?

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Is that really necessary?

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:26.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s --
-Probably not.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Probably not.
-Probably not.

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:29.656
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:32.358 size:84% position:42%
And yet, there you are.

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:33.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There I am.

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
-By the way,
I hosted it once, so...

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:39.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. So you really know
the second one´s the dumb one.

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:41.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, look,
I just think it´s a --

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:43.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
it´s an incredible force
of nature.

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know, we want
to document what is happening,

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:50.443
and to see that up close is --
is a really extraordinary thing.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:51.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The only thing --
the only argument I´ll make,

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:54.747
is I feel like part of it is you
guys tell people to stay inside.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:57.817
-Right, and yet, we are outside.
-Well, also, if I´m inside,

00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:00.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I know black T-shirt
Anderson Cooper is outside...

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Chuckles ]
You´re gonna go outside.

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:02.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I´m gonna go out
and try to meet you.

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.525
-When it really gets bad, people
do not go outside, thankfully.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that´s good.
-But the funny thing is --

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was -- I was, you know,
I was there for days.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.497 size:75% position:38%
And I´m literally --

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:13.900
You´re literally on air for,
you know, 10 hours at a time.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.068
And it´s wind, and it´s rain --

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:16.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean,
that´s what it boils down to.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so by hour nine,
you´re like,

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.841 size:84% position:42%
"Remember six hours ago

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
when I said it was windy
and rainy?

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well now it´s really,
really windy."

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:30.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
"And it´s rainy, too."

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:32.018 size:81% position:41%
But the only thing is,

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:35.021 size:88% position:44%
my mom kept e-mailing me
while I was on the air

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
because --
-So your mom --

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:37.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
Gloria Vanderbilt.
-Yes.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.792 size:84% position:42%
-A very famous designer
and actress and model.

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, yes.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:44.063
She is now 93, and I just
got her to join Instagram.

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:47.333
-Uh-huh.
-And she has now become obsessed

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
with Instagram
and with her Instagram account

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:51.504 size:84% position:42%
to the -- first of all,

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:53.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
my mom didn´t understand
what Instagram was.

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:56.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it took many times
for me to try to explain it.

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:58.077
She still didn´t quite get it.

00:02:58.077 --> 00:03:00.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
But -- But then,
I made her an account,

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.614
because I thought
she might get a kick out of it,

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:04.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I promoted it
on my Instagram account.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:07.687
And she went from zero to like
130,000 followers very quickly.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:11.124
And I happened to be with her
as the count started going up.

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:15.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like
Christmas times 1,000 for her.

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:17.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was like, "This is
the most incredible thing."

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:18.531 size:88% position:44%
She had -- The idea that

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:21.801
anybody would be interested in
what she was doing thrilled her.

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:23.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
She had no idea.
-Instant addiction, then.

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:24.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Instant addiction.
-Yeah.

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:27.440
-To the point now she e-mail --
my mom never e-mailed me before.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
She never called me
for most of my life.

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:30.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:33.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
She now e-mails me
about 20 times a day,

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:35.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
and 10 of them are,
"Should I post this picture?"

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:37.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:39.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what´s annoying is,
when she e-mails,

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:40.587 size:75% position:38%
she doesn´t believe,
when she hits "Send"

00:03:40.587 --> 00:03:42.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
that the e-mail
necessarily goes out.

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:44.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
So she´ll send three copies
of the same e-mail.

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:46.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
So I --

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.561
And then -- then, an hour later,

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:50.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
it´s, "Maybe it should be
this picture."

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:52.832
And then I´ll finally say,
"Why don´t you do this picture?"

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:54.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´ve limited her.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:55.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´d say,
"Look, no more than two a day.

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:56.769 size:84% position:42%
You don´t want to be
one of those, you know,

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:58.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
people who needs
an Instagram intervention."

00:03:58.605 --> 00:04:02.308
And then she´ll e-mail me, "What
should I say about the picture?"

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:04.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m like, "You know what?
I got a job to do."

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:05.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I -- This -- I´ve --

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:07.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Does she have
any appreciation or sense

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:08.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you are
in the middle of a hurricane?

00:04:08.448 --> 00:04:09.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no.
-Yeah.

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:11.718
-She´ll be like --
no, she really, really doesn´t.

00:04:11.718 --> 00:04:14.420
Like, in fact, I e-mailed her
one time -- I e-mailed her back.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.222
I was like, "You know, actually,
I´m -- I´m on the air.

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:18.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m in Fort Myers.
You know, the storm is coming.

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:20.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I´ve been on
for nine hours."

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
No recognition of it.
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:24.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She´d just send another one
like, "Oh, sorry.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:27.000
Well, let me just quickly ask
you, what about this picture?"

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
So...

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:30.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well,
you opened Pandora´s box there

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:31.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
by teaching
your mom to Instagram.

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:32.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did, I did. Yes, yeah.
-That´s all on you.

